# This repository is PUBLIC. Member data must never be committed to it.
#
# The lodge roster — names, birthdays, home addresses, dues, attendance —
# lives in the Google Sheet and is served at runtime through /api/*, which
# whitelists the handful of fields the public page is allowed to see
# (api/_lib.mjs, PUBLIC_FIELDS). Keep it that way: anything committed here is
# public immediately and stays in the git history permanently, even if the
# file is deleted in a later commit.

# Secretary's workbooks and anything generated from them
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.csv
RSM_*.pdf
IMPORT-REPORT.md

# Apps Script project — import-*.js embeds roster data
appscript/
import-*.js
*.gs

# Local environment
.env
.env.*
.vercel/
node_modules/
.DS_Store
